OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer jailed for rape and       
OL,4,Acoercive behaviour                     
OL,6,FA police officer has been jailed for 10
OL,7,Fyears and four months for rape and     
OL,8,Fcontrolling and coercive behaviour.    
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset PC Stephen Phipps was
OL,11,Ffound guilty of the two offences at    
OL,12,FExeter Crown Court earlier this month. 
OL,13,FHe was sentenced at the same court on  
OL,14,FFriday.                                
OL,16,FThe 45-year-old, from Bridgwater in    
OL,17,FSomerset, was arrested and immediately 
OL,18,Fsuspended after the victim reported the
OL,19,Foffences in February 2023. The force   
OL,20,Falso referred itself to the Independent
OL,21,FOffice for Police Conduct.             
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
