OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer jailed for rape and       
OL,4,Acoercive behaviour                     
OL,6,FIn a statement read out in court, the  
OL,7,Fvictim said: "The impact that his abuse
OL,8,Fhas had on me cannot be overstated. It 
OL,9,Faffected every aspect of my life and   
OL,10,Frelationships."                        
